  "releaseNotes": "Native library 1.2.1: start_split and start_merge copy their input, so a split or merge stream no longer reads the input after the call that started it has returned. Targets .NET 10. Projects on .NET 8 or 9 can use 1.2.0, which has the 1.2.0 library without this fix: dotnet add package EdiFabric.Native.X12 --version 1.2.0",
